{{!
    @template paygw_mercadopago/subscribe

    Onde o aluno informa o cartao da assinatura.

    Tres modos, e a diferenca nao e visual: ela decide o caminho que o numero
    do cartao percorre. No brick e no direto o formulario sai daqui vazio e o
    JavaScript o preenche; no nativo os campos sao deste arquivo, e e o unico
    caso em que o numero chega ao nosso servidor.

    O campo escondido recebe o token que o navegador produz. E um so: quem
    cobra e um segundo token, gerado no servidor a partir do cartao ja
    guardado.

    NO MODO BRICK O FORMULARIO FICA VAZIO E ESCONDIDO, e o Brick vive FORA
    dele. O Card Payment Brick renderiza o proprio <form> e o proprio botao de
    pagar; aninhado no nosso, o navegador descarta o interno e o clique submete
    o externo - sem token. Foi o que aconteceu na primeira prova.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region=mp-card-fields

    Context variables required for this template:
    * formaction string
    * sesskey string
    * amount string
    * periodo string
    * ciclos string
    * cancelurl string
    * methodcard bool
    * methodpix bool
    * methodboleto bool
    * showcard bool
    * showpix bool
    * showboleto bool
    * cardurl string
    * pixurl string
    * boletourl string
    * brick bool
    * direct bool
    * native bool

    Example context (json):
    {
        "formaction": "https://exemplo.test/payment/gateway/mercadopago/subscribe.php?ref=mdlsub-1-2-abc",
        "sesskey": "abc123",
        "amount": "R$ 49,90",
        "periodo": "Cobranca a cada 30 dias.",
        "ciclos": "Ate voce cancelar.",
        "cancelurl": "https://exemplo.test/local/marketplace/mysubscriptions.php",
        "methodcard": true,
        "methodpix": false,
        "methodboleto": false,
        "showcard": true,
        "showpix": true,
        "showboleto": false,
        "cardurl": "https://exemplo.test/payment/gateway/mercadopago/subscribe.php?ref=mdlsub-1-2-abc&method=card",
        "pixurl": "https://exemplo.test/payment/gateway/mercadopago/subscribe.php?ref=mdlsub-1-2-abc&method=pix",
        "boletourl": "https://exemplo.test/payment/gateway/mercadopago/subscribe.php?ref=mdlsub-1-2-abc&method=boleto",
        "brick": true,
        "direct": false,
        "native": false
    }
}}
<div class="paygw-mercadopago-subscribe">
    <p class="lead">{{#str}} subscribeamount, paygw_mercadopago, {{amount}} {{/str}}</p>

    {{#periodo}}
        <ul class="list-unstyled text-muted small">
            <li>{{periodo}}</li>
            <li>{{ciclos}}</li>
            <li><a href="{{cancelurl}}">{{#str}} subscribewheretocancel, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}</a></li>
        </ul>
    {{/periodo}}

    {{!
        Cartao, Pix ou boleto - cada um recarrega a pagina com ?method=X. Nao
        e JavaScript: e o jeito mais simples de mostrar so o formulario certo,
        sem duplicar logica de mostrar/esconder no cliente.
    }}
    <ul class="nav nav-tabs mb-3">
        {{#showcard}}
        <li class="nav-item">
            <a class="nav-link {{#methodcard}}active{{/methodcard}}" href="{{cardurl}}">
                {{#str}} subscribecard, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}
            </a>
        </li>
        {{/showcard}}
        {{#showpix}}
        <li class="nav-item">
            <a class="nav-link {{#methodpix}}active{{/methodpix}}" href="{{pixurl}}">
                {{#str}} subscribepix, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}
            </a>
        </li>
        {{/showpix}}
        {{#showboleto}}
        <li class="nav-item">
            <a class="nav-link {{#methodboleto}}active{{/methodboleto}}" href="{{boletourl}}">
                {{#str}} subscribeboleto, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}
            </a>
        </li>
        {{/showboleto}}
    </ul>

    {{#methodpix}}
        <p class="text-muted small">{{#str}} subscribepixnotautomatic, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}</p>
        <form method="post" action="{{formaction}}">
            <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
            <input type="hidden" name="selectedmethod" value="pix">
            <div class="row g-3">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <label for="mp-payer-name-pix" class="form-label">{{#str}} payername, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="mp-payer-name-pix" name="payername" autocomplete="name" required>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <label for="mp-payer-doc-pix" class="form-label">{{#str}} payerdoc, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="mp-payer-doc-pix" name="payerdoc"
                        inputmode="numeric" maxlength="11" required>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4">
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">
                    {{#str}} subscribeconfirm, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}
                </button>
            </div>
        </form>
    {{/methodpix}}

    {{#methodboleto}}
        <p class="text-muted small">{{#str}} subscribeboletonotautomatic, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}</p>
        <form method="post" action="{{formaction}}">
            <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
            <input type="hidden" name="selectedmethod" value="boleto">
            <div class="row g-3">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <label for="mp-payer-name-bol" class="form-label">{{#str}} payername, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="mp-payer-name-bol" name="payername" autocomplete="name" required>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <label for="mp-payer-doc-bol" class="form-label">{{#str}} payerdoc, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="mp-payer-doc-bol" name="payerdoc"
                        inputmode="numeric" maxlength="11" required>
                </div>
                <div class="col-12">
                    <strong class="small">{{#str}} payerboletoaddress, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <label for="mp-payer-zip" class="form-label">{{#str}} payerzipcode, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="mp-payer-zip" name="payerzipcode"
                        inputmode="numeric" maxlength="8" required>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <label for="mp-payer-street" class="form-label">{{#str}} payerstreet, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="mp-payer-street" name="payerstreet" autocomplete="address-line1" required>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-2">
                    <label for="mp-payer-number" class="form-label">{{#str}} payerstreetnumber, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="mp-payer-number" name="payerstreetnumber" required>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-5">
                    <label for="mp-payer-neighborhood" class="form-label">{{#str}} payerneighborhood, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="mp-payer-neighborhood" name="payerneighborhood" required>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-5">
                    <label for="mp-payer-city" class="form-label">{{#str}} payercity, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="mp-payer-city" name="payercity" autocomplete="address-level2" required>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-2">
                    <label for="mp-payer-state" class="form-label">{{#str}} payerstate, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="mp-payer-state" name="payerstate" maxlength="2" required>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4">
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">
                    {{#str}} subscribeconfirm, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}
                </button>
            </div>
        </form>
    {{/methodboleto}}

    {{#methodcard}}
        {{> paygw_mercadopago/card_fields }}
    {{/methodcard}}
</div>
